0EA EQUATE P2CONH  
0EB EQUATE P2CONL
0EC EQUATE P2INT   
0ED EQUATE P2PND  
0EE EQUATE P4CON   
0EF EQUATE P4INTPND  
0F0 EQUATE FADDR   
0F1 EQUATE EP0CSR 
