0FA EQUATE EP2FIFO 
0FB EQUATE EPMODE 
0FC EQUATE EP1BCNT
0FD EQUATE EP2BCNT 
0FE EQUATE USBCON

END-EQUATES \ 45 EQUATES
\ READ ONLY     4
\ WRITE ONLY    0
\ READ/WRITE    41
\ UNKNOWN       0

